   <dc:description>
    <rdf:Alt>
     <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Golden Italian editorial: darker median (~93), high saturation (0.39), yellow-dominant hues (48%), brown-gold shadows (36,30,15), warm skin (hue 30). Best for: Sun-drenched outdoor weddings, Tuscany-style venues, sunset portraits, haldi and yellow/gold outfits, sandstone forts of Rajasthan. Not for cool blue-hour frames.</rdf:li>
    </rdf:Alt>
   </dc:description>
